    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcdfda73684c5c920974559d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毫无根据的谣言也传进了樱花桂冠耳里，\n她不禁担心起成田白仁处在这种气氛下\n或许会让她难以专心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0652b474a01966c5943d3eecafc49227370ca5982d6ed3c9b6bc923b81c8d17a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcf9eb40bcbabcb8755002eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0602a3b44cc518839ca18249",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而成田白仁却显得毫不在意。\n她把全副注意力都集中在即将挑战的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38389db2f7744367b63be490f31c9368dc3b6714c9acce95242cbc9f1a9f244c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70a355e16014b03baa916b95",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d6a406215f8784d0151ec35",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这令樱花桂冠有所警惕，惊觉该更集中精神。\n她怀着唯一的目的挑战比赛──\n只为了追上心中的憧憬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67d6825f356cf21284276013a21be87037b89a813cd857b7bf56d8907c41978d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
