    {
      "uid": "zhcn:887b79efd56cb40d8d9883f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠的脚已完全康复。\n可以毫无疑虑地尽情挑战“中山金杯”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17d1882b3eb12717f5fe5e8080c93be09d42ca65611713c468955d00ae12460f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9338fb197a94615b55de2e9c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:018673632a1849f031b3c965",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花千代王与樱花进王也到场声援，\n更加提振了她的士气。\n她高声宣言一定会夺下第一名后迈步踏向赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fb6d30b082d95d8bc57a0eb84fcfcb5afdc40b4364f891833c883bcf6fb70a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076411.json",
      "json_path": [
