    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2623376d5f88fe02c4f181b3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了这一天，\n樱花桂冠已努力做尽了一切训练。\n只能默默忍受的寒冬终于过去了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aeac62e6c82242d40aa735e6e8596af0c0e0ef602717a7255f8693fafaad00f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
