    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cefb0c623a2ed4ddc4b63000",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "心里已没有一丝忧虑及不安。\n她带着高涨的自信，\n迈步踏上“天皇赏（春）”的赛道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffccc2bd648219d76271b1ff8702afcd1ef2408e00774a2bdb23296537d736bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
