    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b91237a5553d6704eb29795",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（秋）”在满场欢呼声中开跑。\n最受瞩目的成田白仁散发出如同野兽的魄力……\n狂野地呼吸着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "984c3a6d00026ffde166015df0560d33b8f01e602e94126087be37ca00ec18a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
