    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f60039adfa81d66f83cbf2a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了帮助正在奋力挣扎的憧憬对象，\n也为了让自己成为成田白仁的憧憬，\n樱花桂冠带着坚强的意念前往赛道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "122480a8fbfd9292a48f11f274b7a64428b0d610c1c849adba6a807a82a889eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
