    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d6817ce1c057c7f09c22907",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田白仁仍陷在迷惘之中。\n从小追逐至今的琵琶晨光的背影从眼前消失，\n令她失去了前进的方向。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09cfb3224c06716b4aaa1f79b4ea93a8c43ec8f34ef888781026e0406b6ce6ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
