      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“日本杯”当天。\n樱花桂冠对成田白仁发出宣告。\n我要跑在你前方，成为你的憧憬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81ab1df42d5e3874beb811e5e68445e5f675b8ddcf16badb4ae9b3b64d8cce13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
