      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "让我带你去看曾经你让我看见的那道光芒的彼端。\n就如同之前的你也总是跑在最前头，\n令我有所憧憬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4721568177838cf4a8a3bf9588249040301751de6a307aa8479def66e88ad648",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
