      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠下定决心跑出\n能够刺激成田白仁向前迈进的表现。\n为此，她走向了赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec17d585878a9a602619f11f2612c90b56ff1fde1e3f9caf39821d9b577c4546",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
