    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22480a8102c9b0769bdc5d26",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来到“有马纪念”的人们怀抱着各种思绪。\n菱亚马逊肩负着来自后辈的期待，\n而重炮想跑出令人着迷的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cc3a7895a6a4f9ce49a5831fdd8b87d66456a196517c5525db2ea89301d1816",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
