    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95a4cce103f477ed2ea139e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美丽周日一心期待上场决战，\n而成田白仁在姐姐的鼓励之下迈步奔跑。\n还有──",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b669382169f00a5c23d7e653323b48be0ae1af473811a0f0b8f353b6096228b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
