    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:729c2fef2c4fe5e6019bdde8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一定要超越实力又见提升的憧憬对象，\n再用自己的双脚迈向远在未来的梦想。\n“有马纪念”即将开幕──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0a153bc94e4f3a9e3f01ffeee22ed21b04823d55ba31468f4907987b0c69d6d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076416.json",
      "json_path": [
