    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad09f23bc6d8284ebca61fa5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员亲眼见证了樱花桂冠漂亮地跑完出道战。\n担心她脚受重挫的恶梦因此消散，\n取而代之的是满溢的崭新希望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a7fc34f92a4c0b254c5b9d8a279297ec5b0dec4c170968da8ec4d4fcfa3d592",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076417.json",
      "json_path": [
