    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:698507801554be9b396992f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员再次坚定了热切的期望，\n想与樱花桂冠一起实现前进“凯旋门赏”的梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27a4b5f0d45856690b8add4d7dd066ef1d8b1477e1d90f34d8f0d4ecfbace6b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076417.json",
      "json_path": [
