    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f32d64f24f239596be55868",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过樱花桂冠并不因此气馁。\n她表示想从目前做得到的事开始着手，\n力求明年能够参加“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad06dcb9205b2cf65fe843ba160449c1f4a40f35058929a54d904e81639c99e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
