    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad49769e717dadd926a290ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・因为那双眼睛闪闪发光",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ae370db88b9b6ee7eb06cd8a96568bd527951acdfe4074ced0d417d912180b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6882998f14c397e3d6fccb5a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠对成田白仁怀着不为人知的憧憬。\n一口气引爆能量向前冲刺……\n那就是她心中理想的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f31a08b9356ca1b4411476d1cd17657fddbb60fb9ef81574b92adf5daacc2b68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:977e76dfc9a29242ad22eaae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她仍无法进行负担较重的训练。\n为了能够更接近理想的跑法，\n她决定继续努力观摩研究。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d3d29f6e2b00108ed5a61187a791164a959d5a473ae438f8c90966ab17b4bcf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cffbc1f9631e987e1cbb9b92",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而成田白仁与菱亚马逊勇闯经典赛的\n模样是那么耀眼。\n樱花桂冠心中焦急日渐强烈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f45c39e7879d515f7e81494a2d619dc775eecedf55ca595ecd934f296d96818",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1f4d07095d12106ccab28a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她甩开迷惘，敦促自己专注于目前做得到的事。\n──在GⅢ以上的比赛跑进前三名。\n别逞强，依照自己的步调累积战果吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee7b27b32bb0eaea188d5a5d065b8a566fac2ed373d8a34f0f222aa93ca64650",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4d356bad8b3bbf3bd9e1b05",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标达成后・追逐",
      "source_fingerprint": "e55cfc46c8efc4119a6402c6369b6d341ddc008af5eda392db3a13a06a9f37d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:909239bd4f14b60129d53fdf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b12446ea14ff5d05eadf3ce1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田白仁以压倒性的强悍称霸“皋月赏”。\n全场为之沸腾，\n最强称号迅速深植人心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "723974a610692f556fcbba12d70470db5a0ce8b81d4460a72fb8e55075664d22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe8118862eb7a67c5fde4acf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b95de8f40ffbdaeed8cd4fc0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "使得樱花桂冠的憧憬之心又更为强烈。\n自己办不到的跑法，\n足以击垮一切的理想跑法──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9351a5866ae590f0fa2b94cb849f4a188c3e8da5a6bd2aa1656982cd92eb3f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6392a978092438111cabf502",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:664bfa0c75c2161c5dfcaef6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好想赢过最强的跑法──\n她涌起了沸腾般的渴望。\n想在“日本德比”一决高下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4abc915e8b2a86c41612598c3aaa0884e0442414178c0a485474c86afbf4573",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98188136db7213bd42686620",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
