    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d22d7f34956e393fa38b554a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠赢得“皋月赏”。\n在经典三冠舞台上胜利的喜悦是如此不同凡响，\n令她不禁燃起征服“日本德比”的野心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9de151696918f41e71f9eac7e31384fe18b05cf3ab48d7679dfb23eb3cc30dfa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076420.json",
      "json_path": [
