    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ea8f8a66c4ac64563875995",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但医生也提醒她的脚距离崩坏只差一步之遥。\n要是跑得太用力而超出极限，\n恐怕会断送她的竞赛生涯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "393e3174462e180dfb95ea21f740c2776d5358f35e41983765aec67851504c17",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
